  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• To prepare the ingredients, finely dice the onion and slice the mushrooms. Peel and crush the garlic. Finely chop the parsley and finely grate the Parmesan cheese."
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large pot, add the vegetable stock powder and the boiling water, then place over a low heat to keep warm.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5554284cf8b25e5d0c8b456b/step_556ead640172b.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large saucepan, heat the olive oil over a medium heat and sauté the brown onion for 5 minutes or until soft. Add the arborio rice, coat the grains and toast for 1 minute. Pour in the dry white wine, sprinkle in half of the mushrooms and cook for 2 minutes until the wine reduces slightly. Add a ladle of hot vegetable stock and stir continuously until the stock has been absorbed and then add another ladle. Repeat this process for approximately 25-30 minutes or until the rice is cooked ‘al dente’.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5554284cf8b25e5d0c8b456b/step_556ead6425816.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, heat the butter in a frying pan over a medium heat. Add the garlic, the remaining mushrooms and a pinch of salt. Cook for about 5 minutes, stirring occasionally until the mushrooms are brown and juicy. Add in half of the parsley.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5554284cf8b25e5d0c8b456b/step_5695d693546a1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Scrape the mushrooms and any pan juices into the risotto, taste and season accordingly. Then add half of the Parmesan cheese and stir well.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5554284cf8b25e5d0c8b456b/step_556ead645b80c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide the risotto between bowls and sprinkle with the remaining Parmesan cheese and parsley."
    }
  ]
}
